             /316
             /TBTAC - ENTER TEST IF SSW 0 
             /NOT DEPRESSED
             /TRANSFER CONTENTS OF PROCESSOR AC
             /AS DETERMINED BY THE LEFT SWITCHES
             /TO THE TAPE BUFFER (TB)
             /THEN TRANSFER CONTENTS OF PROCESSOR AC
             /AS DETERMINED BY THE RIGHT SWITCHES 
             /TO THE TAPE ACCUMULATOR (TAC)
             /NOW ADDITION OF TB TO TAC IS DONE
             /THE SUM IS READ BACK AND TESTED FOR
             /DISCREPENCY AGAINST A COMPUTED SUM
             /STORED IN INDEX REGISTER 12
             /IF THERE ARE ANY ERRORS THE PROGRAM
             /WILL HALT
             /IF SENSE SWITCH 1 IS DEPRESSED
             /THE PROGRAM WILL LOOP ON THIS TEST
             /OTHERWISE IT WILL CONTINUE WITH THE
             /NEXT TEST
00206  0011  TBTAC,  CLR             /CLEAR AC
00207  0500          IOB             /EXECUTE IN 8 MODE
00210  6151          6151            /TRANSFER OF AC TO TAPE MAINTENANCE REGISTER
00211  0517          LSW             /SELECT TB BIT PATTERN WITH LEFT SWITCHES
00212  1040          STA             /STORE COPY OF TB BIT PATTERN SELECTED
00213  0010          10              /IN REGISTER 10
00214  0500          IOB             /EXEC 8 MODE
00215  6154          6154            /TRANSFER OF AC TO TB
00216  1020          LDA I           /LOAD THE AC
00217  1000          1000            /BIT 2 SET
00220  0500          IOB             /EXEC 8 MODE
00221  6151          6151            /TRANSFER OF AC TO TAPE MAINTENANCE REGISTER
00222  0516          RSW             /SELECT TAC BIT PATTERN DESIRED WITH RIGHT SWITCHES
00223  1040          STA             /STORE A COPY OF TAC BIT PATTERN
00224  0011          11              /IN INDEX REGISTER 11
00225  0500          IOB             /EXEC 8 MODE
00226  6154          6154            /TRANSFER OF AC TO TAC
00227  1200          LAM             /ADD CONTENTS OF INDEX REGISTER 10
00230  0010          10              /TO THE AC (2S COMPLEMENT ADDITION)
00231  1040          STA             /STORE THE COMPUTED SUM OF TB ADDED TO TAC
00232  0012          12              /IN INDEX REGISTER 12
00233  1020          LDA I           /LOAD THE AC
00234  0400          400             /BIT 3 SET
00235  0500          IOB             /EXEC 8 MODE
00236  6152          6152            /THE TB IS ADDED TO THE TAC AND THE SUM IS IN THE TAC
00237  0011          CLR             /CLEAR THE AC
00240  0003          TAC             /TRANSFER THE TAC TO THE AC
00241  1440          SAE             /COMPARE THE BIT PATTERN IN THE AC
00242  0012          12              /WITH THE COMPUTED SUM IN INDEX REGISTER 12
00243  0000          HLT             /ERROR - THE CONTENTS OF AC NOT EQUAL TO IR 12
00244  0461          SNS I 1         /IS SENSE SWITCH 1 DEPRESSED
00245  6206          JMP TBTAC       /YES,LOOP TBTAC TEST AGAIN
             /404
             /SHRWB - ENTER TEST IS SENSE SWITCH 1 IS NOT DEPRESSED
             /TRANSFER CONTENTS OF PROCESSOR AC TO TAPE BUFFER (TB)
             /THEN TAPE BUFFER IS TRANSFERRED TO READ WRITE BUFFER (RWB)
             /THE RWB IS NOW SHIFTED
             /ONE BIT POSITION AND ITS CONTENTS READ
             /BACK TO THE AC AND COMPARED WITH A
             /SIMULATED SHIFT IN THE PROCESSOR
             /IF AN ERROR OCCURS THE PROGRAM WILL HALT
             /THE THREE BITS SHIFTED OUT FROM UNDER
             /THE READ WRITE HEAD ARE MASKED OUT AS
             /THEY COULD BE EITHER SET OR RESET
             /IF SENSE SWITCH 2 IS DEPRESSED YOU WILL
             /LOOP THIS TEST.  OTHERWISE YOU WILL GO
             /BACK TO THE BEGINNING OF THE PROGRAM
             /AND START THRU AGAIN
00246  0011  SHRWB,  CLR             /CLEAR AC
00247  0500          IOB             /EXEC 8 MODE
00250  6151          6151            /AC - MAIN REG
00251  0517          LSW             /SELECT BIT PATTERN DESIRED FROM THE LEFT SWITCHES
00252  0500          IOB             /EXEC IN 8 MODE
00253  6154          6154            /TRANSFER OF AC TO TB
00254  0261          ROL I 1         /ROTATE RIGHT 1 PLACE MSB LOST
00255  1560          BCL I           /CLEAR BITS THAT WILL BE SHIFTED IN FROM TAPE READ HEAD
00256  0421          0421            /BITS 3,7, AND 11
00257  1040          STA             /STORE A COPY OF THE BIT PATTERN
00260  0010          10              /IN IR 10
00261  1020          LDA I           /LOAD THE AC
00262  1000          1000            /BIT 2 SET
00263  0500          IOB             /EXEC 8 MODE
00264  6152          6152            /TRANSFER OF TB TO RWB
00265  1020          LDA I           /LOAD AC
00266  2000          2000            /BIT 1 SET
00267  0500          IOB             /EXEC 8 MODE
00270  6152          6152            /SHIFT RWB
00271  1020          LDA I           /LOAD THE AC
00272  3400          3400            /BITS 1,2,AND 3 SET
00273  0500          IOB             /EXEC 8 MODE
00274  6151          6151            /TRANSFER AC TO TAPE MAINTENANCE REGISTER
00275  0011          CLR             /CLEAR AC
00276  0500          IOB             /EXEC 8 MODE
00277  6154          6154            /TRANSFER OF RWB TO AC
00300  1560          BCL I           /CLEAR OUT BITS THAT WERE UNDER R-W HEAD
00301  0421          0421            /BITS 3,7, AND 11
00302  1440          SAE             /COMPARE BIT PATTERN IN THE AC
00303  0010          10              /WITH THE ORIGINAL IN IR 10
00304  0000          HLT             /ERROR - CONTENTS OF AC NOT EQUAL TO INDEX REGISTER 10
00305  0462          SNS I 2         /IS SENSE SWITCH 2 DEPRESSED
00306  6246          JMP SHRWB       /YES, LOOP THIS TEST
00307  6021          JMP TTAC        /NO, LOOP TO BGIN PROGRAM AGAIN
             /471    JMP TTAC IS END
